# {{NAME}} eval procedure

1. Install the pack by symlink and start a fresh session with no other context.
2. Give the prompt of one scenario exactly as written. Do not hint at the skill by name unless the scenario does.
3. Score against the Expected behaviour column: pass only when every part is met; note which part failed.
4. Record the date, the model and the result in the scenario's Result cell, and a one-line cause for any failure.
5. A failure becomes a Learned entry or a fix in the reference it exposed; rerun the scenario afterwards.
6. A scenario the skill passes without being installed does not test the skill: tighten it.
